  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759113,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10-Pin Bowling - Nintendo Game Boy\n\nStep into your very own virtual bowling alley with *10-Pin Bowling* for the Nintendo Game Boy! This classic pastime is meticulously recreated, bringing the sights, sounds, and nostalgia of a traditional American bowling alley directly to your handheld. Forget waiting for a lane – enjoy a game anytime, anywhere!\n\nExperience the thrill of aiming for a perfect game or a satisfying 7-10 split. The game boasts detailed graphics, showcasing polished mahogany lanes and authentic bowling alley atmosphere. Hone your skills and improve your average before the virtual leagues begin! \n\n*10-Pin Bowling* offers a simple yet engaging gameplay experience, perfect for casual players and bowling enthusiasts alike. Test your precision and strategy as you master the art of the strike. It's a pocket-sized bowling experience that captures the fun and challenge of the real thing. Get ready to roll!"
    },
